WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.269 --> 00:00:04.700
Another Thing Dr. Bright Is Not Allowed To
Do At The Foundation: Showing Monty Python

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.610
episodes to SCP-239 was not a wise decision.

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:11.890
Please never try this with any other reality-warping
SCP.

00:00:11.890 --> 00:00:13.720
Seriously, Dr. Bright.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.270
The Witch Child is a reality warper so powerful
we need to keep her in a comatose state to

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.100
stop her from permanently reformatting our
universe.

00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:25.380
Do you really think it’s a good idea to
show her Flying Circus or the Holy Grail?

00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:30.039
If we find that, by sheer coincidence, we
later need to contain an anomaly that shares

00:00:30.039 --> 00:00:35.140
a remarkable resemblance to the Black Beast
of Argh, we know exactly who is responsible,

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.720
and we will not take this indiscretion lightly.

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.370
We might even make you sit on the comfy chair!

